{"id":"n62404-1-25","stage":2,"title":"차이 · 差异","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62404-1-25-1","ko":"이건 아까 것이랑 뭐가 다른가요?","zh":"这个和刚才那个有什么不同吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이랑","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른가요?","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/165ec31e5910978e973c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62404-1-25-2","ko":"기능 면에서는 차이가 없고 디자인만 다릅니다.","zh":"功能上没有区别，只有设计不一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기능","meaning":"功能，机能","explanation":"기능：功能，机能","readings":[{"term":"기능","audio":"/audio/0e09e85c99c11646eebb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32491","senseId":"1","lemma":"기능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"면에서는","meaning":"面，方面","explanation":"면：面，方面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"면","audio":"/audio/cd4530df02c851d2b57a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16110","senseId":"4","lemma":"면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차이가","meaning":"差异，差别","explanation":"차이：差异，差别；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차이","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62404","senseId":"1","lemma":"차이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디자인만","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다릅니다.","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0e09e85c99c11646","term":"기능","zh":"功能，机能","audio":"/audio/0e09e85c99c11646eebb.mp3","entryId":"32491","definition":"起到某种角色或作用；或指那种角色或作用。","pronunciation":["기능"]},{"id":"cd4530df02c851d2","term":"면","zh":"面，方面","audio":"/audio/cd4530df02c851d2b57a.mp3","entryId":"16110","definition":"事情的某个侧面或一面。","pronunciation":["면ː"]},{"id":"b9b47d9dee081fde","term":"차이","zh":"差异，差别","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3","entryId":"62404","definition":"互不相同；或指相互间不同的程度。","pronunciation":["차이"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ab8ca656b1577018eea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62404","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1234,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个和刚才那个有什么不同吗？","功能上没有区别，只有设计不一样。","喂！不要随便越过那条线哦！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个和刚才那个有什么不同吗？","功能上没有区别，只有设计不一样。","喂！不要随便越过那条线哦！"],"answer":1}]}
